The BEMC matches the acceptance of the full TPC for tracking. Some TPC tracks are associated with the BEMC points due to random combinatorics. We compare the distance between the TPC track projection position and the reconstructed BEMC point position. Due to the poorly developed showers in the case of hadrons, this distance Figure 4.8: The number of SMD hits for electron candidates (upper panel) and hadrons (bottom panel).

